ystem</italic></td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;LGG 2004 (CNS 2004 03)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Cooperative multicentre study for children and adolescents with low-grade glioma</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">III</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">0&#x02013;16 years</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Open</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;PNET4 &#x02003;(CNS 2003 05)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">A prospective randomised controlled trial of hyperfractionated <italic>vs</italic> conventionally fractionated radiotherapy in standard risk medulloblastoma.</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">III</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">4&#x02013;22 years</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Closed December 2006</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;SIOP Ependymoma (CNS 1999 04)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">SIOP study of combined modality treatment in childhood ependymoma</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">III</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">3&#x02013;21 years</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Open</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;st PNET &#x02003;(CNS 2004 01)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Hyperfractionated Accelerated Radiotherapy (HART) with chemotherapy (Cisplatin, CCNU, Vincristine) for non-pineal supratentorial primitive neuroectodermal tumours</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">III</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">3&#x02013;18 years</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Open</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign